# A design the compiler rejects

One aggregate embedding another turns two consistency boundaries into one.

## aggregate Customer
identified by id

- id: uuid, required
- name: text, required

invariant "a customer always has a name":
  name is not empty

## aggregate Order
identified by id

- id: uuid, required
- customer: Customer, required

invariant "an order always names its customer":
  id is not empty
